<title>USA: U.S. mortgage application volume rose in latest wk.</title>
<headline>U.S. mortgage application volume rose in latest wk.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The volume of U.S. mortgage applications rose 0.5 percent in the week ended February 14, according to a Mortgage Bankers Association of America weekly survey.</p>
<p>Specifically, the volume of applications to refinance mortgages rose 5.9 percent in the latest survey week, while applications to purchase mortgages fell 1.4 percent.</p>
<p>The seasonally adjusted refinancing index rose 5.9 percent to 401.5 from 379.2 the previous week.</p>
<p>The purchase index fell 5.9 percent to 167.3 in the latest survey from 177.8 in the previous week.</p>
